# Lox Sandwich

Based on [https://newsletter.ethanchlebowski.com/p/…](https://newsletter.ethanchlebowski.com/p/dont-overpay-foods-restaurant) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250712122324/https://newsletter.ethanchlebowski.com/p/dont-overpay-foods-restaurant))

