## Ingredients

- [ ] [Toasted bagel]{ ing="toasted-bagel" }
- [ ] Creamy & tangy cream [cheese spread. Alternatively]{ ing="cheese-spread-alternatively" }, Avocado isn’t traditional, but works
- [ ] [Cured salmon]{ ing="cured-salmon" } or lox*
- [ ] [Crispy & pungent onions]{ ing="crispy-pungent-onions" }
- [ ] [Salty & acidic capers]{ ing="salty-acidic-capers" }
- [ ] [Optionally add herbs]{ ing="optionally-add-herbs" } or cucumber slices

## Recipe

1. Cut a [bagel]{ ing="toasted-bagel" } in half and toast the slices to warm them through. Add layers of your desired fillings.
